<title>SINGAPORE: IDT International may list in Singapore.</title>
<headline>IDT International may list in Singapore.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hong Kong-listed consumer electronics company IDT International Ltd said on Thursday it had received in-principle approval from the Stock Exchange of Singapore to list its unit IDT Holdings (Singapore) Ltd.</p>
<p>IDT said in a statement dealing in the new shares was expected to commence in the first quarter of 1997 if the company decided to proceed with the listing.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
